@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Welcome to AlgoFit@Algoromida!";
}

<div>
    <ul>
        <li>
            <p>
                What is <strong>Thermogena</strong>?<br>
                Thermogena is an artificially cognitive prototype working at algoFit at algoromida as a personal assistant.
            </p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p>
                What can <strong>Thermogena</strong> do?<br>
                Thermogena provides new ideas for thermogenic or fat-burning workouts and food ingredients as well as recipes of thermogenic ingredients. As a treat, Thermogena can help you pair wine with food or pair food with wine!
            </p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p>
                What can't <strong>Thermogena</strong> do?<br>
                Thermogena can not do anything other than what it is supposed to do. In these cases, thermogena delegates control to Dona from the algoChat cluster.
            </p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p>
                How can I interact with  <strong>Thermogena</strong>?<br>
                Once you register and become a member, you can chat with Thermogena.
            </p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p>
                When can I interact with  <strong>Thermogena</strong>?<br>
                You can chat with Thermogena right now, right here! As a matter of fact, you can chat with Thermogena anywhere and anytime as long as you have access to the internet and have a facebook account.
            </p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p>
                How is Thermogena from algoFit different Dona from algoChat?<br>
                Thermogena is becoming an expert in thermogenesis or the concept of fat-burning exercises and foods. Dona is a social conversational chatbot that tells jokes and help users take advantage of the other chatbots at algoromida.
            </p>
        </li>
    </ul>
</div>
